## Pi Source Code

Pi's installed npm package lives at `/usr/lib/node_modules/pi-coding-agent/`.
Note that the published package ships only `dist/`, `docs/` and `examples/`
(upstream `files` list), so there is no `src/` tree here — for the real
TypeScript sources clone https://github.com/earendil-works/pi.

Key paths that do exist in this layout:
- CLI entry (what /usr/bin/pi runs): `dist/bundle/cli.js`
- Docs: `docs/`
- Example extensions: `examples/`
